<title>UK: Courtaulds Textiles jumps on profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds Textiles jumps on profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Courtaulds Textiles jumped by 5.5 percent in pre-market trading on Friday after the company issued forecasted stronger profits for the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>The shares were indicated 12-1/2p higher at 240 in pre-market trading at 0817 GMT.</p>
